     Views: Missing referenced rows
  4. dqdemo.Customer joined with dqdemo.Campaign
     Keys: c.CompanyId = g.CompanyId; c.CustomerId = g.CampaignId
     Views: Missing referenced rows
  5. dqdemo.Customer joined with dqdemo.OrderHeader
